Id: ngx013w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_nginx
Fix: Log errors at info or above (error_log /var/log/nginx/error.log).
References: ngx_http_core_module
Controls: CIS 8.2; NIST AU-2, AU-12; ISO 8.15

Error logging runs at debug level in the file and line named. Debug
logs record request bodies, headers and secrets, and grow fast; info
or above is enough in production. It also only runs on a nginx
built with --with-debug.
